{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00819","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 肃顺 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 肃顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我后至孝，祗谒祖先。\n仰瞻庙貌，夙设宫悬。\n朱弦疏越，羽舞回旋。\n神其来格，明祀惟虔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}